---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site, fullAddress } from '../data/site';
const updated = '17 October 2026';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${site.legalName} collects and uses personal data submitted through this website.`}>
  <section class="about-hero"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="tagline">Last updated: {updated}</p></section>
  <section class="about-section prose">
    <p>This policy explains how {site.legalName} ("we", "us") handles personal data collected through {site.url}. It is written to follow India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you send a message or quote request, we collect the details you enter: your name, company, email address, phone number, the product you are interested in and your message. We do not collect payment information on this website.</p>
    <h2>Why we use it</h2>
    <p>We use these details only to reply to your enquiry, prepare quotations and, if you become a customer, to fulfil your orders. We do not sell or rent your personal data.</p>
    <h2>Who can see it</h2>
    <p>Your message is delivered by email to our sales team. Our web host and email provider process the data on our behalf to make this possible.</p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep enquiry emails for as long as needed to respond and to maintain business records, and delete them when no longer required.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>This website does not use advertising cookies. If we enable website analytics, it is used only to understand which pages are useful, and this policy will be updated to say so.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete the personal data we hold about you, or withdraw your consent, by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>{site.legalName}, {fullAddress}. Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
